This package is the replication record for the article "Stars Misaligned:
Medicare Star Ratings And Exact Clustering" (Matthew D. Schwartz, 2026) and
its online appendix: the code, the verification records and the parsed
public inputs behind every number in both documents.

Third-party components: CMS's published 2026 Overall Hospital Quality Star
Rating R program is run by hospital/work/driver.R but is not included; the
pin list CMS_RAW_PINS.json gives its source URL and hash. No other
third-party code is included.
